#: scenario9:scenario9_46706B49_29D8_4537_B65A_0914A867078C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17e6632c4d3167d12ce93571acc4953b5261eee02b770b6afa35ac3ca5388661
